{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "english", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1722470400, "end_date": 1723161599, "month_true_total": 10632, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:15:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "171715629", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983311834", "personaname": "Yuns", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/radicalmoof/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 27977, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16957, "last_played": 1771638125, "avatar": "b96165c31e98666c30943a323e36bfca23da051f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't play this game *for the time being.*\n\nI don't think I have ever seen a good game marred by such consistently terrible patches.\n\nRight now it's in a bad place, and the Devs seem to be panicking and making some really bad, shortsighted decisions. Sadly, I'd suggest considering holding off on buying until it's clear that has passed.", "timestamp_created": 1723161594, "timestamp_updated": 1723788953, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533233761787414551", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171715510", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030021973", "personaname": "Legalize Menthols", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xxmaster27xx/", "num_games_owned": 1356, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 46373, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 161, "playtime_at_review": 19087, "deck_playtime_at_review": 314, "last_played": 1787147994, "avatar": "f4f2fc58620a769dfcc51defda89ed5cb8fa7d75"}, "language": "english", "review": "How about here?", "timestamp_created": 1723161434, "timestamp_updated": 1723161434, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522388041019439697", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171715487", "author": {"steamid": "76561198211605556", "personaname": "DuDuBot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198211605556/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 14182, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13153, "last_played": 1782405747, "avatar": "b8a6f62b8b7bd48279016ddb5616f9a555b0cf5d"}, "language": "english", "review": "如果荣都一开始就开放，那他是一座万千抗争虽败犹荣的城市。\n如果他在新加坡倒下的时候开放，那他是和纽约上海三足鼎立共同抗敌的城市。\n如果他在纽约倒下的时候开放，那他也是帮上海分摊了火力完成战略目标的城市。\n但是dss都修好了，容都还没开放，那他只能是一座没有勇气战斗，出卖其他六座城市，只为了自己安全，在最后关头窃取胜利果实的超级叛徒。\n\n2025-05-29 上海解放进度锁99.9783%\n超级叛徒只配超级差评\n\n敵は容都にあり\n\n各位超级潜兵请自行决定要不要参与斯德哥尔摩战场", "timestamp_created": 1723161407, "timestamp_updated": 1748521441, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171715475", "author": {"steamid": "76561198127321134", "personaname": "zeroknight12", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198127321134/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 50202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 765, "playtime_at_review": 34073, "last_played": 1788029718, "avatar": "17037fbae85e70dea402269770bd33b980cef902"}, "language": "english", "review": "It’s been almost a year since I last left a review, and back then, I had a lot of issues with the game. But after 11 months and a bunch of updates, I’ve got to say,my opinion’s changed.\n\nIt’s pretty rare these days for devs to actually listen to their community, but the team behind Helldivers 2 clearly does. They’ve dropped a bunch of updates and events, and with each one, you can tell they’re actively paying attention,tweaking gear, adjusting enemies, and doing real balancing work.\n\nWhat I really appreciate is that they’re not just throwing out random changes. They’re clearly trying to keep everything fair and fun, no single weapon or strategy feels like the “only” way to play anymore. And enemies? They don’t feel like endless bullet sponges now.\n\nLong story short: the game’s in a much better place. I’m genuinely having fun with it again. I would definitely recommend people give this game a chance and play it.", "timestamp_created": 1723161389, "timestamp_updated": 1754100450, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171715367", "author": {"steamid": "76561198202775499", "personaname": "Zxur", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Zxur/", "num_games_owned": 71, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 15879, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 145, "playtime_at_review": 7090, "last_played": 1787215868, "avatar": "d3eb39d70f297a4191bea908797cd7972a77ad86"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes", "timestamp_created": 1723161249, "timestamp_updated": 1723161249, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494071155786514282", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}